{"seq":1,"slug":"worker-queue-rate","title":"Worker 队列与速率控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/merchant-bulk-async-job-api/job-execution/worker-queue-rate","wordCount":2454,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"worker-队列与速率控制\">Worker 队列与速率控制</h1><p>分片表落库之后，任务并不会自己跑起来。需要一个 worker 持续地从待处理分片里取活、执行、写回结果。这个取任务的动作看起来只是一条查询，但它决定了整个执行层的三个核心性质：多个 worker 之间会不会重复执行同一份工作、worker 崩溃后未完成的分片多久能被别人接手、以及平台的总吞吐由什么参数控制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>最朴素的取任务实现是「查—判—改」三步：查询待处理分片、判断是否可用、标记为处理中。这个实现在单 worker 下没问题，多 worker 下必然出错——两个 worker 可以在第 2 步和第 3 步之间同时读到同一条记录。</p>\n<p>正确做法是把「选定」和「占有」合并成一次原子操作。关系型数据库提供了两种手段：悲观锁（<code>SELECT ... FOR UPDATE</code>）和条件更新（<code>UPDATE ... WHERE status = &#39;PENDING&#39;</code>）。前者适合长事务内立即处理的场景，后者适合「认领后异步处理」的场景。批量任务平台通常两者都用：用条件更新做认领，用行锁做租约续期的并发保护。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  W1[worker A] --&gt; Q{批量认领}&#10;  W2[worker B] --&gt; Q&#10;  W3[worker C] --&gt; Q&#10;  Q --&gt;|SKIP LOCKED| S1[shard 17 租约 60s]&#10;  Q --&gt;|SKIP LOCKED| S2[shard 18 租约 60s]&#10;  S1 --&gt; X[执行分片 17]&#10;  S2 --&gt; Y[执行分片 18]&#10;  X --&gt; R[续期租约 / 写回终态]&#10;  Y --&gt; R\">graph TD\n  W1[worker A] --&gt; Q{批量认领}\n  W2[worker B] --&gt; Q\n  W3[worker C] --&gt; Q\n  Q --&gt;|SKIP LOCKED| S1[shard 17 租约 60s]\n  Q --&gt;|SKIP LOCKED| S2[shard 18 租约 60s]\n  S1 --&gt; X[执行分片 17]\n  S2 --&gt; Y[执行分片 18]\n  X --&gt; R[续期租约 / 写回终态]\n  Y --&gt; R</pre><h2 id=\"认领式取任务\">认领式取任务</h2><h3 id=\"skip-locked-的语义\">SKIP LOCKED 的语义</h3><p>PostgreSQL 对 <code>SKIP LOCKED</code> 的描述直指这个用例：「使用 <code>SKIP LOCKED</code> 时，任何无法立即获得锁的已选行都会被跳过」，并明确它「不适用于通用场景，但可用于在多个消费者访问队列式表时避免锁竞争」（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-select.html\">PostgreSQL SELECT</a>）。批量任务的分片表正是典型的队列式表。</p>\n<p>一次原子认领的完整形式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH claimed AS (&#10;  SELECT id FROM bulk_job_shards&#10;   WHERE status = &#39;PENDING&#39;&#10;     AND attempt_count &lt; 5&#10;   ORDER BY priority DESC, id&#10;   LIMIT $1                                  -- 一次认领的批量大小&#10;   FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED&#10;)&#10;UPDATE bulk_job_shards s&#10;   SET status = &#39;RUNNING&#39;,&#10;       worker_id = $2,&#10;       lease_expires_at = now() + interval &#39;60 seconds&#39;,&#10;       attempt_count = attempt_count + 1,&#10;       started_at = COALESCE(started_at, now())&#10;  FROM claimed c&#10; WHERE s.id = c.id&#10;RETURNING s.id, s.job_id, s.range_start, s.range_end;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> claimed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bulk_job_shards</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PENDING'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attempt_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> priority DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                  -- 一次认领的批量大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SKIP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LOCKED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bulk_job_shards s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RUNNING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       worker_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       lease_expires_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'60 seconds'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       attempt_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attempt_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       started_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(started_at, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> claimed c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">job_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">range_start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">range_end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个细节决定这条 SQL 是否正确。<code>WITH ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED</code> 在同一个语句里完成「选」与「锁」；<code>UPDATE ... FROM claimed</code> 复用被锁定的行；<code>RETURNING</code> 返回认领结果。若拆成两条语句，<code>FOR UPDATE</code> 的锁会在事务结束后释放，两个 worker 仍可能拿到同一行。</p>\n<p><code>attempt_count &lt; 5</code> 是一个硬性的放弃条件。没有它，一个必然失败的分片会被无限重试，占用 worker 时间——这正是死信队列要解决的问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"认领批量与空转\">认领批量与空转</h3><p><code>LIMIT $1</code> 控制单次认领多少个分片。取 1 会让 worker 在每次分片完成后都往返一次数据库；取过大则会导致某些分片被认领后长时间排在本地队列里还没开始跑，其他 worker 却以为它们已经在处理中。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[worker 主循环] --&gt; B[认领一批分片]&#10;  B --&gt; C{认领到?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[逐个执行]&#10;  D --&gt; B&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[退避 sleep]&#10;  E --&gt; F{sleep &lt; 5s?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[sleep *= 2]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[sleep 保持 5s]&#10;  G --&gt; B&#10;  H --&gt; B\">graph TD\n  A[worker 主循环] --&gt; B[认领一批分片]\n  B --&gt; C{认领到?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[逐个执行]\n  D --&gt; B\n  C --&gt;|否| E[退避 sleep]\n  E --&gt; F{sleep &lt; 5s?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[sleep *= 2]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[sleep 保持 5s]\n  G --&gt; B\n  H --&gt; B</pre><p>折中做法是认领一小批（例如 4–8 个）并在本地逐个执行。更细的做法是让 worker 主动「领一个跑一个」，用小批量加高频率。选择依据是分片本身的时长：分片越长，认领批量的影响越小。</p>\n<p>当查询返回 0 行时，worker 应当退避而不是立即重查。固定间隔轮询（例如每秒一次）在空闲期会产生大量无效查询；指数退避到上限（例如 5 秒）能把空闲开销压到可忽略。上图的退避是<strong>无抖动</strong>的，因为空转重查没有惊群风险——所有 worker 查同一张表得到同一个空结果，不产生压力。这与下游调用重试的退避需要抖动形成对比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"租约与心跳\">租约与心跳</h2><h3 id=\"租约超时后的重新认领\">租约超时后的重新认领</h3><p><code>lease_expires_at</code> 是崩溃恢复的唯一机制。worker 崩溃后不会有人主动把它的分片标回 <code>PENDING</code>，所以必须有一个<strong>回收者</strong>定期扫描过期租约：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE bulk_job_shards&#10;   SET status = &#39;PENDING&#39;,&#10;       worker_id = NULL,&#10;       lease_expires_at = NULL,&#10;       last_error = COALESCE(last_error, &#39;lease_expired&#39;)&#10; WHERE status = &#39;RUNNING&#39;&#10;   AND lease_expires_at &lt; now()&#10;   AND attempt_count &lt; 5;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bulk_job_shards</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       worker_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       lease_expires_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       last_error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(last_error, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lease_expired'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RUNNING'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lease_expires_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attempt_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>回收者应当由<strong>独立的定时任务</strong>承担，而不是让 worker 顺带做。原因是 worker 崩溃时，正是它自己最不可能执行回收——虽然其他 worker 仍会跑，但让每个 worker 都扫描全表会带来不必要的竞争。一个独立的、单实例的回收任务语义最清晰。</p>\n<p>租约时长需要权衡：太短则正常但较慢的分片会被误判为过期，导致重复执行；太长则崩溃恢复慢。经验取值是「分片 p99 处理时间的 3–5 倍」。若分片粒度设计得当（见 <a href=\"../async-job-model/job-shard-chunk\">任务分片与分块提交</a>），这个数字是可控的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"心跳续期\">心跳续期</h3><p>长分片必须主动续期，否则会被回收者误判。心跳的做法是定期执行带 worker 归属校验的条件更新：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE bulk_job_shards&#10;   SET lease_expires_at = now() + interval &#39;60 seconds&#39;&#10; WHERE id = $1&#10;   AND worker_id = $2&#10;   AND status = &#39;RUNNING&#39;&#10;RETURNING lease_expires_at;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bulk_job_shards</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lease_expires_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'60 seconds'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> worker_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RUNNING'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING lease_expires_at;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>若返回 0 行，说明租约已被回收（或 worker 身份已失效），当前 worker 应当<strong>立即停止</strong>正在执行的工作。这一点常被忽略：worker 即使发现租约丢了也可能继续跑完，结果是两个 worker 同时写同一批行。行级幂等能吸收这个后果，但浪费的计算是真实的，且对于有外部副作用的操作（例如发货）会造成真正的重复调用。</p>\n<p>心跳间隔取租约时长的三分之一左右。60 秒租约配 20 秒心跳，允许连续两次心跳失败而不丢租约。</p>\n<h2 id=\"速率控制\">速率控制</h2><h3 id=\"三层限速\">三层限速</h3><p>平台的吞吐不是无限的，瓶颈可能在三个不同的地方：worker 数量（CPU）、下游服务（外部 API 的 QPS 限制）、目标数据库（写入吞吐）。这三层必须分别限速，任何一层缺失都会在压力下暴露。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>控制点</th>\n<th>典型手段</th>\n<th>超限后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>worker 层</td>\n<td>并发分片数</td>\n<td>固定 worker 池 + 认领上限</td>\n<td>本地资源争抢，延迟上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下游层</td>\n<td>对外调用速率</td>\n<td>令牌桶，按下游配额配置</td>\n<td>下游 429，任务大量失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库层</td>\n<td>写入行速率</td>\n<td>批大小 × 批频率，或连接池上限</td>\n<td>锁等待、复制延迟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>下游层的 429 处理需要特别设计：HTTP 规范定义 429 时说明响应「可以包含一个 <code>Retry-After</code> 头，指示在发起新请求前应当等待多久」（<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6585.html\">RFC 6585</a>）。平台应当遵守这个头，而不是用固定的退避间隔覆盖它。忽略 <code>Retry-After</code> 会在下游限流时持续撞墙，把可恢复的限流变成持续的失败。</p>\n<h3 id=\"退避与抖动\">退避与抖动</h3><p>任务重试和分片重试都需要退避。朴素做法是固定间隔，会在下游恢复的瞬间形成惊群。指数退避能摊开重试时刻，但如果所有分片使用相同的退避序列，它们仍会同步。</p>\n<p>标准解法是加入随机抖动。AWS 架构博客给出的 Decorrelated Jitter 形式是 <code>sleep = min(cap, random_between(base, sleep * 3))</code>，即下一次等待时间在基准值与上次等待时间的三倍之间随机取值，并以上限截断；该文指出抖动方案相比朴素指数退避明显更快完成，其中 Decorrelated Jitter 完成时间略优于 Full Jitter，而 Full Jitter 产生的调用次数更少（<a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/architecture/exponential-backoff-and-jitter/\">AWS Architecture Blog</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"base = 200ms; cap = 30s&#10;sleep = base&#10;on_failure:&#10;    sleep = min(cap, uniform_random(base, sleep * 3))&#10;    wait(sleep)&#10;    if attempt_count &gt; max_attempts:&#10;        move_to_dead_letter()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>base = 200ms; cap = 30s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sleep = base</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>on_failure:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sleep = min(cap, uniform_random(base, sleep * 3))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    wait(sleep)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if attempt_count > max_attempts:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        move_to_dead_letter()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>选择 Decorrelated 还是 Full Jitter，取决于在意完成时间还是调用总量：下游计费按调用计则选 Full Jitter，追求任务尽快完成则选 Decorrelated。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>退避策略</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定间隔</td>\n<td><code>sleep = c</code></td>\n<td>简单，恢复瞬间惊群</td>\n<td>几乎不用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指数退避</td>\n<td><code>sleep = min(cap, base·2^n)</code></td>\n<td>收敛快，但多客户端同步</td>\n<td>单客户端重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Full Jitter</td>\n<td><code>sleep = random(0, min(cap, base·2^n))</code></td>\n<td>调用次数最少</td>\n<td>下游按调用计费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Equal Jitter</td>\n<td><code>sleep = half + random(0, half)</code></td>\n<td>保证最小等待</td>\n<td>需要下界保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Decorrelated</td>\n<td><code>sleep = min(cap, random(base, sleep·3))</code></td>\n<td>完成时间最短，无需记 n</td>\n<td>任务尽快完成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Full Jitter 与 Decorrelated 的差异在实现状态上：Full Jitter 需要知道尝试次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，Decorrelated 只需要上一次的 <code>sleep</code> 值。当重试发生在不同进程或不同分片之间、尝试次数难以准确维护时，Decorrelated 的无状态特性是实际优势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"吞吐与并发的区分\">吞吐与并发的区分</h2><h3 id=\"并发不等于吞吐\">并发不等于吞吐</h3><p>提高 worker 池大小会增加<strong>并发</strong>，但不一定增加<strong>吞吐</strong>。若瓶颈在下游 QPS 限额或数据库写入能力，增加 worker 只会让更多分片同时卡在等待上，反而因为锁竞争降低总吞吐。</p>\n<p>判断瓶颈位置的方法是观察分片处理时间的分布：若 P99 远高于 P50 且随并发上升而恶化，说明在等共享资源；若 P99 与 P50 接近且随并发上升基本不变，说明是纯 CPU 或纯 IO 受限，可以加 worker。</p>\n<h3 id=\"并发上限的确定\">并发上限的确定</h3><p>一个实用的做法是先确定下游配额，再反推 worker 并发：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = \\min\\left(P_{cpu},\\ \\frac{Q_{downstream}}{q_{per\\_shard}},\\ \\frac{W_{db}}{w_{per\\_shard}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.503em;vertical-align:-1.053em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">am</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.053em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.053em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{downstream}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">am</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是下游每秒可接受的调用数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_{per\\_shard}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7976em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单个分片每秒产生的下游调用数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{db}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是数据库每秒可写入的行数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{per\\_shard}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7976em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 类似。取三者最小值，并留 20–30% 余量给突发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多 worker 取任务必须用原子操作，「查—判—改」三步在并发下必然重复执行。</li>\n<li><code>WITH ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED</code> 加 <code>UPDATE ... FROM</code> 加 <code>RETURNING</code> 是一条语句完成的正确认领形式；拆成两条会丢失锁语义。</li>\n<li>认领条件里必须有 <code>attempt_count</code> 上限，否则必然失败的分片会被无限重试。</li>\n<li>租约超时是崩溃恢复的唯一机制，必须由独立回收者扫描；租约时长取分片 p99 的 3–5 倍。</li>\n<li>长分片需要心跳续期，且心跳失败时 worker 必须立即停止工作，不能跑完。</li>\n<li>限速分三层：worker 并发、下游调用速率、数据库写入速率；三层必须独立配置。</li>\n<li>遵守下游 429 响应里的 <code>Retry-After</code>，不要用固定退避覆盖它。</li>\n<li>重试退避加抖动；Decorrelated Jitter 的公式是 <code>sleep = min(cap, random_between(base, sleep*3))</code>，在完成时间上略优于 Full Jitter，后者调用次数更少。</li>\n<li>并发不等于吞吐；通过分片处理时间的分布判断瓶颈在等待共享资源还是在本地受限。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>worker 取到分片并开始执行后，下一个问题是同一行被处理两次会怎样——见 <a href=\"row-idempotent-partial\">行级幂等与部分成功</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Worker 队列与速率控制","id":"worker-队列与速率控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"认领式取任务","id":"认领式取任务"},{"level":3,"text":"SKIP LOCKED 的语义","id":"skip-locked-的语义"},{"level":3,"text":"认领批量与空转","id":"认领批量与空转"},{"level":2,"text":"租约与心跳","id":"租约与心跳"},{"level":3,"text":"租约超时后的重新认领","id":"租约超时后的重新认领"},{"level":3,"text":"心跳续期","id":"心跳续期"},{"level":2,"text":"速率控制","id":"速率控制"},{"level":3,"text":"三层限速","id":"三层限速"},{"level":3,"text":"退避与抖动","id":"退避与抖动"},{"level":2,"text":"吞吐与并发的区分","id":"吞吐与并发的区分"},{"level":3,"text":"并发不等于吞吐","id":"并发不等于吞吐"},{"level":3,"text":"并发上限的确定","id":"并发上限的确定"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"任务分片与分块提交","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/merchant-bulk-async-job-api/async-job-model/job-shard-chunk"},"next":{"title":"行级幂等与部分成功","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/merchant-bulk-async-job-api/job-execution/row-idempotent-partial"}}